OL,3,AGabon says access to social media
OL,4,Arestored after eight-month ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FGabon says it has lifted a ban on
OL,7,Fsocial media imposed eight months ago -
OL,8,Fa move that triggered widespread
OL,9,Fcriticism at the time.
OL,11,FThe High Communication Authority (HAC)
OL,12,Fannounced the U-turn on Saturday in a
OL,13,Ftelevised statement. The BBC has
OL,14,Fapproached the country's media
OL,15,Fregulator for comment.
OL,17,FThe ban had been introduced on 17
OL,18,FFebruary, with the HAC saying that
OL,19,Fonline content was fuelling conflict
OL,20,Fand deepening divisions in the country.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
