OL,3,AGabon says access to social media
OL,4,Arestored after eight-month ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move came as a shock to the central
OL,7,FAfrican nation of about 2.5 million
OL,8,Fpeople, where social media platforms
OL,9,Fsuch as Facebook, TikTok, YouTube and
OL,10,FInstagram have been particularly
OL,11,Fpopular with younger people who use it
OL,12,Ffor business as well as pleasure.
